{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8b7cac35922904139e17b93cfc613d3239976f1b7936eda5ada9ffedd2d43f98",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fe8b7b63fbb8b5b2b765134640cce0fc3f728f0b2552ff310d85d8eb936ac35",
      "text": "世界上独一无二的生日咖喱",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12913a74fc568fa6eabd579ff8cb95049a985c1692cd65c47ac42eb5d61aff11",
      "text": "冬马的生日快到了。\n翔太和北斗计划在派对上用亲手做的咖喱\n招待冬马。而冬马虽然\n没有察觉到两人的意图，\n却敏锐地嗅到了咖喱的香味……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61f0252f5a72212c5d00075fef732179ccd4555b9d3fcd2cf9b9ac86b4f948c5",
      "text": "嗯……嗯嗯！今天的咖喱，\n感觉特别棒。说不定是至今为止最好吃的一次呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec5a286f118de614c990fd38ec12628775a25d02c070ab1e91c32847da1e53a4",
      "text": "呵呵，你果然也这么觉得？\n我虽然挺有自信，不过翔太都这么说了，那就肯定没错了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70119a82d6ff988574ae016a399c671f2cf832df12ccfc4a3b123c533aa46e39",
      "text": "要是吃到这么好吃的咖喱，\n冬马君肯定会大吃一惊吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b933487ee0c57b160767886fa02c8adb23d2e30b1da3c9a00abf66ecd3296f4",
      "text": "嗯。真让人期待呢。好，那我去休息室布置\n餐桌吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45aa2e11bb19cfb66e4997acd1efb7279d1712e18ce06b607d0fca57ee5d3540",
      "text": "好～唔，那我稍微休息一下下～\n在派对开始前得好好养精蓄锐才行♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3404e582401978021b8ab29ebf16d3d5757fc4c36c2d25a622343ce9d15464e8",
      "text": "咖喱和蛋糕，不知他是否喜欢呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c20e4933c676f99ccbd3619bc0150d199aea72301d15c698015435db375aa12f",
      "text": "啊，真是最棒的礼物了。没想到居然为了我，\n准备得这么周全……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a69ff1289c95ed11c2e6ae08ac3ecb74e8a7184f5c9aad92e9b1edf56f47f6f",
      "text": "太好了。不过，其实除了食物之外，\n我们还准备了其他的礼物哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d123e8ab158de06b7f4de0c16b8fa87a7966bf820e76e1f3dd4baa48318fb9d",
      "text": "是吗！？不用这么费心\n也没关系的……谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed8e1b6b1da7547d3a01aedf9833162aab43f7cd6ddcca1b25ed88195854ff23",
      "text": "并不是费心客气啦。只要一想象冬马开心的样子，\n我和翔太不知不觉就干劲十足了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a80799bf0230ffbae8aeda3cfd44ff6a48a394fb933be282ac51bc0a28853da1",
      "text": "啊～真好吃呢。\n和冬马君平时吃的咖喱比起来怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:274c20be120831c84f2464178e7daad0ce077aa463b02f9e63d0730eac5c3a94",
      "text": "感觉看似相似，浓郁度与层次感却完全不同啊……\n可恶，好想知道秘密调料是什么啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ead6a195530486fd6776656fca722dbcdce4cbabdf8fc4ce666c43be5af9a647",
      "text": "嘿嘿，这可是秘密哦。不过我也开始有点想念\n冬马君做的咖喱了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:525872caa3eb1a219cc9c153bc58e38bfdc67e72c6d0b7995731edff71154595",
      "text": "刚才不是才吃了一大堆咖喱吗……\n算了，想吃我做的，随时再给你做就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_001tom_2_1_2_001_12:1_2_001_12_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c13f2b2774a9b6de6fd4f377897c3731c113033d169a1737514c88fc32f0370e",
      "text": "不愧是冬马君！\n我很期待哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
